From c335c76cfe2b029d0db568c1e8ff2d46f4d32204 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SteveDeFacto <5148995+SteveDeFacto@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 04:49:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Platform host policy: no default production mirrors (R2)

PRODUCTION_MIRRORS = [] as installed: the four former fleet routes shared one infrastructure operator. A document reaches
a gate through an operator-chosen mirror or a policy carrier. 4106c311 with only this line changed rebuilds the admission
bundle to the installed 6bef372d byte-for-byte (D's reproduction target; job b1-admission).

The four tests that used the default list as their fleet now name those routes explicitly (FLEET_MIRRORS) and assert the
default is empty. The admission bundles are regenerated in the next commit (A's entry change), not here.
---
